@startuml
title Change Language Sequence (Mobile local settings)

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Learner
boundary "Change Language UI" as LanguageUi
control "AppSettingsNotifier\n(FE Controller)" as SettingsController
control "LocalStorage\n(Device)" as LocalStorage

note over LanguageUi, LocalStorage
Checked in current code:
Language is changed by AppSettingsNotifier.setLocale(languageCode).
The selected locale is saved to LocalStorage with StorageKeys.appLocale.
No FE DTO, BE DTO, API controller, repository, DbContext or database is used.
end note

Learner -> LanguageUi: Select language
LanguageUi -> SettingsController: setLocale(languageCode)
SettingsController -> SettingsController: Normalize to en or vi
SettingsController -> LocalStorage: Save StorageKeys.appLocale
LocalStorage --> SettingsController: Saved language code
SettingsController -> SettingsController: Update AppSettingsState.locale
SettingsController --> LanguageUi: Rebuild localized UI

@enduml
